OL,3,GNEWSAChild safety improvements too
OL,4,Aslow, says report
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges to how vulnerable children are
OL,7,Fprotected from harm in parts of Dorset
OL,8,Fhave been "too slow", inspectors have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FA joint inspection of agencies in
OL,12,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,13,F(BCP) found children usually received a
OL,14,Fquick and effective response when
OL,15,Fconcerns about them were raised.
OL,17,FBut it said harm caused to children by
OL,18,Fneglect and domestic abuse was not
OL,19,Falways spotted quickly, and some
OL,20,FClare's Law disclosures were made by
OL,21,Fofficers who were not always trained in
OL,22,Fsafety planning.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
